{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾演出經典諜報大片《新鐵金剛智破皇家賭場》（Casino Royale）的德國首位超級名模薇露希卡（Veruschka）近日傳來辭世消息，在親友的陪伴下於家中平靜走完一生，享壽87歲。</p><p>據外媒指出，這位時尚界傳奇人物生前已安排將部分遺產捐贈予呂訥堡的東普魯士邦立博物館，死訊公開後，立即引發全球時尚圈與影壇人士深切追思。</p><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（《新鐵金剛智破皇家賭場》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202977801162985472284697.png/uea4vqHJuklFbQz4XWLt8MpO1HCQAp16WWoCHFlqAhw\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（《新鐵金剛智破皇家賭場》劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>更多德國名模Veruschka的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980010479063040264587.jpeg/fTfqgPticZChXywnjmWZ6ocGT0O0KOX1C9HXCgvR1wo\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980012693786624436517.jpeg/JdkhKosOx_x--j8DPTyH4hU5c5FErXc4hsEMSobBDEo\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980014589743104542937.jpeg/3ZT57GulGZE91fEyiL0Nj5lkM5T30dg06wla2usJWto\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980016758329344350917.jpeg/bxZnDw7nsdvxIEvEJW1W22SZjk3sGMM0HAqD_RwKg_0\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980018780114944439862.jpeg/kKqTTWW3v6EofEONDE_XKKfDzyYPiPF9-YQ-6PmEPug\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980001763299328978614.jpeg/suqF2BTEBkWNj9hn4wckQ2yMj0Jf3Jn7cEABEnBAARI\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980004053520384178032.jpeg/xVT46WYC_ZvyvYAPCru7TqenfvyHEcd1w4CaWsOAmlo\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980005991419904970432.jpeg/rff5wruhoyb77mWf4TXbDjgWhXNq1W7uuQFONLkBTjQ\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980008273252352390827.jpeg/wmkenyeF1lUK1SY3YkogE85-D6O3S4MwkfjRMpH40TI\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980010462810112476901.jpeg/8YqoQRMjA4fg6lkXGAvoxjSw5EjIQlle89NQbvPTUG4\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980047141474304578912.jpeg/Fmb39Y7unXbX9LpWGgdTixr9LSt3c4svxK9tb8SvbW8\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980049385558016876394.jpeg/gjnjtV8or_7y2TTGMAS0lDpHP0RCDuq9ekB2D3pAdg8\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980051705139200714230.jpeg/G2lDASCdog5CMfIHAIhEqArp8H_xvQD2SoeAfUqHgH0\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202980054058274816841093.jpeg/rwjj2hyKFQU1mJY1BnryboOlrltNj5rnuNXf3bjV390\"/><figcaption>Veruschka（Instagram@veruschkavera）</figcaption></figure><p>消息曝光後，《全美超級模特兒新秀大賽》評審兼知名攝影師奈傑爾巴克（Nigel Barker）隨即在社群平台發文致哀。他提及2001年曾有幸為薇露希卡掌鏡，並將那次合作視為個人職涯的重要里程碑；他感性讚頌對方不僅是風格與優雅的化身，在片場對待團隊更是極為謙遜，讓眾人深刻體會到與真正傳奇共事的意義。</p><p>回顧其電影生涯，現代觀眾對薇露希卡最鮮明的記憶，多半來自2006年經典諜報片《新鐵金剛智破皇家賭場》（Casino Royale）。片中她飾演貴族女賭客「馮瓦倫斯坦伯爵夫人」，在蒙特內哥羅賭場與丹尼爾格力（Daniel Craig）飾演的占士邦及反派上演緊張的撲克牌對決。</p><p>除此之外，她早年亦曾本色出演義大利名導安東尼奧尼執導的 1966 年經典懸疑名作《春光乍現》（Blow-Up），以極具辨識度的身影驚艷影壇；即便 1975 年因與美國版「Vogue」主編理念不合而淡出時尚伸展台，她仍持續活躍於大銀幕，陸續參演《莎樂美》（Salomé）、《闇黑新娘！》（The Bride）等片。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：32歲女星Jorrybell Agoto淋巴瘤病逝　遺作代表菲律賓角逐奧斯卡】女星喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto淋巴瘤病逝。（Instagram＠epicmediaph）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480223028580352130845.jpeg/hBVC89H1hkpbLlkigkkD8SG6dxGbd3QtcWsV0nFrFdI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：32歲女星Jorrybell Agoto淋巴瘤病逝　遺作代表菲律賓角逐奧斯卡】女星喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto淋巴瘤病逝。（Instagram＠epicmediaph）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480910810550272093581.jpeg/QGPblTncGvRYGmxbcI_alGFuL1IAwOMPYvwsqGL8LKg\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480913432121344387561.jpeg/leOYIHxIGHnbWSe27gm0OIaTWXEQyyxfc5R9YnOUfWI\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480915906891776508392.jpeg/osn2vzdaxAuclnUZmBJw9-kPxCN6_m2qBZBQYQWQUGE\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480918490714112940513.jpeg/azghX4ITcrcW6IV4cDvXC9RCgtQpz9lLhbEON4WxDjc\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480920873209856835671.jpeg/2N-2m3wiIHN1gd7pOKPqFOBXLfHbPvuvSFpGbkhaRm4\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480899011973120512736.jpeg/M-K5z8EwgI0tYS02VtfMh8_pdqrGSVwgYT4pb2E-KW8\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480901335748608974203.jpeg/n0vW4AmkdsGxE26vs95ENIKZ9Qv8Zj8xjvU-Y471PmM\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480903646941184390541.jpeg/9zduWbF3jjXhIyZ3ZlRCfMSCJwMchOv_EswACBLMAAg\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480910102106112138045.jpeg/UyL9jY7RrFQN-SBGZDVwAEBipzCuxgda_5a9pP-WvaQ\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480912237137920201638.jpeg/jFt6xVr7cFppyxqo3Ln8MyHhIBRr3efSpr0O96a9Dvc\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200480882633216000540379.jpeg/9T0f0tO71omUeJYJug4yYj979LvObAv2QBBs_EAQbPw\"/><figcaption>喬莉貝爾阿戈托Jorrybell Agoto（Instagram@jorrybell）</figcaption></figure><p>舒淇自爆金馬獎「出意外」　提詞器突消失！靠腦海記憶班門弄斧</p><p>跨種族愛戀！永瀬廉國寶級神顏化身最強鬼族　霸氣告白「我的新娘」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.316685+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1802,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:15:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:24.401608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:24.401608+00:00","content_hash":"38dd60a67958777a4223586b4b20f308286d4efd6a70d506e059900ec5f753c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}